      "start_line": 55,
      "text": "  rule <k>\n         Subscript(\n           list(vCons(_F:Int, snocVS(_M:ValSeq, L:Int))),\n           UnaryOp(\"-\", Int(1)))\n         => L\n         ...\n       </k>\n       [priority(40)]"
